#---
# purpose: "Macro.escape/1 refuses a PID with ArgumentError and lists the values it can escape: a PID made while compiling names no process in the built program. Elixir escapes a PID as itself, so this fixture has no oracle"
# expect: abort
#---
defmodule Main do
  def main(), do: Macro.escape({:owner, self()})
end

Main.main()
